        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/BBA26-5.3.2> ;
    ipbes:hasCategory "Table SPM 7Gaps in knowledge and its application." ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Incomplete knowledge within businesses of their impacts and dependencies on biodiversity and nature’s contributions to people, including in relation to how biodiversity loss translates into business risk and informs action. Beyond economic value and productivity, knowledge is lacking on sociocultural valuation, relational values, quality, sustainability, trends and risk of loss" ;
    ipbes:traceability "2.5, 2.8, 4.5, 4.6, 5.3.2" ;
    dcterms:identifier "BBA26-7" .

