        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/BBA26-5.7> ;
    ipbes:hasCategory "Table SPM 7Gaps in knowledge and its application." ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Insufficient evidence to identify and prioritize the actions needed to incentivize businesses with the greatest responsibility for and influence on biodiversity and nature’s contributions to people to perform the most impactful actions" ;
    ipbes:traceability "5.6, 5.7" ;
    dcterms:identifier "BBA26-8" .

