    ipbes:hasCategory "Table SPM 7Gaps in knowledge and its application." ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Gaps in knowledge, data and documentation on species that are important to Indigenous Peoples and local communities and information on the rights and knowledge of Indigenous Peoples and local communities relating to benefits arising from the use of genetic resources, with due respect for free, prior and informed consent, in accordance with national legislation" ;
