        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/5081872/items/L5Q64RQX>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/5081872/items/Q5WZ9N8W>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/5081872/items/QEEBNW2R>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/5081872/items/SJZSRX7B>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/5081872/items/VXV7YT82>,
